    "title":  "Under New Management",
    "description":  "After restoring the Thieves Guild to its former glory by completing all four reputation jobs and Darkness Returns, the player is invited to become Guild Master. A ceremony is held in the Ragged Flagon cistern where Brynjolf, Delvin, Vex, and Karliah confirm the appointment. The player receives the Guild Master\u0027s Armor, the Amulet of Articulation, and the Tribute Chest Key.",
